title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "PSOE" and police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/guardia_civil_ametralladora.jpg

= Internal Security

The Gobernación Ministry controls internal security throughout the German Republic. While most police work is delegated to the states, the national security agency can perform special investigations.

As with the state police units and the Reichswehr, the internal police tends to be reactionary, and has serious issues with loyalty to the elected government of the Republic.

- @loyalty: Improve the loyalty of the Guardia Civil.
- @reform_security_forces: Reform and rebalance the two main Security Forces (Guardia Civil & Guardia de Asalto).
- @investigate_corruption: Investigate corruption by big businesses.
- @investigate_far_right: Investigate illegal activity among the far right.
- @domestic_enemies: Investigate or ban our domestic enemies.
- @fund_assault_guard: It's time to create a republican police force. 
- @disperse_generals: Relocate suspicious right-wing generals away from vital centers.
- @raid_mola: Order a decisive raid against General Mola’s headquarters in Pamplona to uncover the plot.
- @arrest_primo: Arrest José Antonio Primo de Rivera, Falange's leader.
- @root: Take no action for now.
- @cancel_advisor_action

@loyalty
on-arrival: guardia_civil_loyalty += 0.1
view-if: assault_guard_formed != 1

The Guardia Civil, despite having sworn loyalty to the republic, is a conservative force. However, we can take a number of steps to increase the body's loyalty.

Current Guardia Civil loyalty: [+ guardia_civil_loyalty : loyalty +]

@reform_security_forces
title: Rebalance and Modernize the Security Forces
subtitle: Manage the internal loyalty of the Civil Guard and Assault Guard.
go-to: security_rebalance_menu

@security_rebalance_menu

- @favor_civil_guard: Favor the Guardia Civil with better equipment and fundings at the expense of the Guardia de Asalto.
- @favor_assault_guard: Empower the Guardia de Asalto with more funding and resources at the expense of the Guardia Civil.
- @joint_modernization: Execute a comprehensive joint modernization program (-2 Budget).
- @police: Return to main security menu.

@favor_civil_guard
title: Prioritize the Guardia Civil
subtitle: Boost Guardia Civil morale and eficiency at the expense of the Guardia de Asalto.
choose-if: guardia_asalto_militancy >= 0.1
unavailable-subtitle: We can't substract more funds from the Guardia de Asalto.
on-arrival: guardia_civil_loyalty += 0.15; guardia_asalto_loyalty -= 0.10; caballeristas_dissent += 3; pce_relation -= 3; guardia_civil_militancy += 0.1; guardia_asalto_militancy -= 0.1;

We allocate new rifles and barracks Guardia Civil. While their officers appreciate the government's recognition, the Guardia de Asalto feels sidelined.

@favor_assault_guard
title: Expand and Favor the Assault Guard
subtitle: Strengthen the loyal urban police force while alienating the Guardia Civil.
choose-if: guardia_civil_militancy >= 0.1
unavailable-subtitle: We can't substract more funds from the Guardia Civil
on-arrival: guardia_asalto_loyalty += 0.15; guardia_civil_loyalty -= 0.10; guardia_civil_militancy -= 0.1; guardia_asalto_militancy += 0.1;

We expand the Guardia de Asalto with new rifles, riot material and motorized units. The urban police grows fiercely loyal to the Republic, but rural Civil Guard officers grow increasingly suspicious of our intentions.

@joint_modernization
title: Invest in a general modernization program
subtitle: -1 Budget — Increase the loyalty and efficiency of both corps simultaneously.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 1 budget.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; civil_guard_loyalty += 0.12; assault_guard_loyalty += 0.12; coup_progress -= 0.5;

We increase the salary of the perssonel, improve the radio communication and provide motorized transport for both forces, increasing the loyalty of the Guardia Civil and Guardia de Asalto at the same time.

@investigate_corruption
go-to: investigate_corruption_success if guardia_civil_loyalty >= 0.5; investigate_corruption_failure if guardia_civil_loyalty < 0.5

@investigate_corruption_success
on-arrival: investigate_corruption += 1; workers_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); inflation -= 0.1 if inflation > 3; inflation -= 0.2 if inflation >= 8; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress >= 1; 

[? if investigate_corruption < 1 : The Guardia Civil uncover financial ties linking billionaire Juan March and conservative magnates to clandestine military funds and weapons smuggling from abroad. Seizing accounts and blocking illicit transfers starves the conspirators of vital liquid capital. ?]

[? if investigate_corruption >= 1 : Corruption in big business is rampant, of course. We have uncovered a number of scandals and publicizing them brings new attention to the work of Gobernación Ministry building its popular appeal and that of the PSOE. ?]


@investigate_corruption_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the police.

@investigate_far_right
go-to: investigate_far_right_success if guardia_asalto_loyalty >= 0.55; investigate_far_right_failure if guardia_asalto_loyalty < 0.55

@investigate_far_right_success
on-arrival: investigate_far_right += 1; mf_strength -= 10 if year <= 1934; mf_strength -= 20 if year >= 1935; workers_ap -= 3; middle_ap -= 3; falange_urgency += 1 if investigate_far_right == 2; falange_urgency += 2 if investigate_far_right == 3; rural_ap -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; smallholders_ap -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; middle_ap -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; unemployed_ap -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 7

[? if investigate_far_right == 1 : We have uncovered secret documetns detailing the *Unión Militar Española (UME)*, a covert network of right-wing officers, alongside promises of  fascist Italian financing signed in Rome. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 2 : We have discovered illegal arms smuggling by the Requetés, the Carlist paramilitary. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 3 : We have found a link of various military officers with the Sanjurjada and some rumours of a new coup. We must do something to stop this plot. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right > 3 : We keep striking paramilitaries and investigating high ranking officers.  [? if coup_progress >= 6: There are reports of an imminent coup by the far-right. We have attempted to disrupt some of these plans, but the threat is still present. ?]


@investigate_far_right_failure

Unfortunately, our investigations have failed to turn up anything. Rumors are that the targets of our investigation were tipped off by infiltrators within the police.

@fund_assault_guard
title: Establish the Guardia de Asalto
subtitle: -2 Budget. This will anger the Guardia Civil.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 2 budget.
view-if: assault_guard_formed != 1 and delay_ga = 1
on-arrival: budget -= 2; assault_guard_formed = 1; pro_republic += 5; guardia_asalto_loyalty = 0.85; workers_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); middle_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); guardia_civil_loyalty -= 0.05; cnt_militancy -= 1

@disperse_generals
title: Relocate Suspicious Generals
subtitle: Transfer right-wing military commanders linked to the coup away from strategic mainland garrisons.
view-if: investigate_far_right >= 3 and generals_dispersed == 0
on-arrival: generals_dispersed = 1; coup_progress -= 1; polarization += 10;  ejercito_militancy -= 0.5;

Using intelligence on the UME, we order key officers to distant posts: General Mola to Pamplona, Franco to the Canary Islands and Goded to the Balearic Islands. Deprived of direct command in Madrid and Barcelona, their ability to launch a synchronized coup is severely damaged.

@raid_mola
view-if: mola_raid == 0 and investigate_far_right >= 4
go-to: raid_mola_success if guardia_asalto_loyalty >= 0.75 and guardia_civil_loyalty >= 0.75; raid_mola_failure if guardia_asalto_loyalty < 0.75 or guardia_civil_loyalty < 0.75

@raid_mola_success
on-arrival: coup_progress -= 1; mola_detained = 1; ejercito_militancy -= 1; mola_raid = 1

We've found many plans and codebooks for an on-going coup preparation. General Mola and key conspirators are place under arrest. Some officers express their disconfort with the detainment of high ranking officers but we have proof of their crimes. 

@raid_mola_failure
on-arrival: mola_raid = 1; coup_progress += 1; ejercito_militancy += 1;

We've found no trace of any ilegality in Mola's Headquarters, nothing links him to the coup. Probably we've been looking at the wrong place. Mola accuses the government of illegal persecution and there's no excuse for us. 

@arrest_primo
title: Arrest José Antonio Primo de Rivera
view-if: investigate_far_right >= 3 and 
choose-if: fe_persecuted >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We need to strike the Falange Española at least once before we can go for its leader. 
on-arrival: primo_detained = 1; pro_republic += 5; polarization += 5; mf_militancy -= 0.1

Following the assassination attempt against Professor Jiménez de Asúa, police raid Falange headquarters, arresting José Antonio Primo de Rivera on charges of illegal firearms possession and sedition.
